      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844262
    m_Localized: The absolute Zero...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844263
    m_Localized: "I can feel the freezing cold taking hold of me, I have to head for a warmer part of the Rift as fast as I can.
But there is almost no escaping all these creatures, I have to take them down to clear a path and go on with the expedition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844264
    m_Localized: The garden of illusions...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844265
    m_Localized: "This place is beautiful, with the eko flowing from these fluorescent plants. It looks so peaceful, but I have to stay on my guard.
For a moment, I even caught a glimpse of a silhouette in the distance that looked like me. My tiredness is starting to play tricks on me..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844266
    m_Localized: The rift has carried you off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 753844267
    m_Localized: Drareg met his end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
